1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,240
Hi Jun. As you know

2
00:00:02,300 --> 00:00:06,620
I've asked you here today to discuss the future of our Self-Access Centre.

3
00:00:06,620 --> 00:00:13,760
We have to decide what we want to do about this very important resource for our English language students.

4
00:00:13,760 --> 00:00:17,710
So, can you tell me what the students think about this?

5
00:00:17,710 --> 00:00:21,440
Well, from the students' point of view, we would like to keep it.

6
00:00:21,440 --> 00:00:25,100
The majority of students say that they enjoy using it

7
00:00:25,100 --> 00:00:27,989
because it provides a variation on the classroom routine

8
00:00:27,989 --> 00:00:32,125
and they see it as a pretty major component of their course,

9
00:00:32,125 --> 00:00:36,950
but we would like to see some improvements to the equipment, particularly the computers;

10
00:00:36,950 --> 00:00:42,120
there aren't enough for one each at the moment and we always have to share.

11
00:00:42,120 --> 00:00:45,978
Well yes, the teachers agree that it is a very valuable resource

12
00:00:45,978 --> 00:00:52,730
but one thing we have noticed is that a lot of the students are using it to check their personal emails.

13
00:00:52,730 --> 00:00:55,722
We don't want to stop you students using it,

14
00:00:55,722 --> 00:01:00,710
but we think the computers should be used as a learning resource, not for emails.

15
00:01:00,710 --> 00:01:09,440
Some of us also think that we could benefit a lot more by relocating the Self-Access Centre to the main University library building.

16
00:01:09,440 --> 00:01:12,000
How do you think the students would feel about that, Jun?

17
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:16,257
Well, the library is big enough to incorporate the Self-Access Centre,

18
00:01:16,257 --> 00:01:19,740
but it wouldn't be like a class activity anymore.

19
00:01:19,740 --> 00:01:25,090
Our main worry would be not being able to go to a teacher for advice.

20
00:01:25,090 --> 00:01:28,190
I'm sure there would be plenty of things to do

21
00:01:28,190 --> 00:01:31,910
but we really need teachers to help us choose the best activities.

22
00:01:31,910 --> 00:01:34,240
Well, there would still be a teacher present

23
00:01:34,240 --> 00:01:36,883
and he or she would guide the activities of the students,

24
00:01:36,883 --> 00:01:39,500
we wouldn't just leave them to get on with it.

25
00:01:39,500 --> 00:01:44,318
Yes, but I think the students would be much happier keeping the existing set-up;

26
00:01:44,318 --> 00:01:47,071
they really like going to the Self-Access Centre

27
00:01:47,071 --> 00:01:51,200
with their teacher and staying together as a group to do activities.

28
00:01:51,200 --> 00:01:56,013
If we could just improve the resources and facilities, I think it would be fine.

29
00:01:56,013 --> 00:01:58,580
Is the cost going to be a problem?

30
00:01:58,580 --> 00:02:01,440
It's not so much the expense that I'm worried about

31
00:02:01,600 --> 00:02:04,367
and we've certainly got room to do it,

32
00:02:04,367 --> 00:02:09,190
but it's the problem of timetabling a teacher to be in there outside class hours.

33
00:02:09,190 --> 00:02:13,106
If we're going to spend a lot of money on equipment and resources,

34
00:02:13,106 --> 00:02:16,720
we really need to make sure that everything is looked after properly.

35
00:02:16,720 --> 00:02:21,920
Anyway, let's make some notes to see just what needs doing to improve the Centre.

36
00:02:21,920 --> 00:02:24,880
Now, what about the computers

37
00:02:25,420 --> 00:02:28,930
I think it might be a good idea to install some new models.

38
00:02:28,930 --> 00:02:31,600
They would take up a lot less room and

39
00:02:31,600 --> 00:02:35,070
so that would increase the work space for text books and so on.

40
00:02:35,070 --> 00:02:38,430
That would be great. It is a bit cramped in there at times.

41
00:02:38,430 --> 00:02:44,370
What about other resources? Do you have a list of things that the students would like to see improved?

42
00:02:44,370 --> 00:02:48,482
Yes, one of the comments that students frequently make is that they find

43
00:02:48,522 --> 00:02:54,640
it's difficult to find materials that are appropriate for their level, especially reading resources

44
00:02:54,640 --> 00:02:57,330
So I think we need to label them more clearly.

45
00:02:57,330 --> 00:03:00,780
Well, that's easy enough, we can get that organised very quickly.

46
00:03:00,780 --> 00:03:07,460
In fact I think we should review all of the study resources as some of them are looking a bit out-of-date.

47
00:03:07,460 --> 00:03:11,650
Definitely. The CD section especially needs to be more current.

48
00:03:11,650 --> 00:03:16,420
I think we should get some of the ones that go with our latest course books

49
00:03:16,420 --> 00:03:18,890
and also make multiple copies.

50
00:03:18,890 --> 00:03:24,960
Good, now I was also thinking about some different materials that we haven't got in there at all.

51
00:03:24,960 --> 00:03:29,560
What do you think of the idea of introducing some workbooks?

52
00:03:29,560 --> 00:03:33,520
If we break them up into separate pages and laminate them

53
00:03:33,520 --> 00:03:35,300
they'd be a great resource.

54
00:03:35,300 --> 00:03:38,958
The students could study the main course book in class

55
00:03:38,958 --> 00:03:42,250
and then do follow-up practice in the Self-Access Centre.

56
00:03:42,250 --> 00:03:48,270
That sounds good. --Okay, now finally we need to think about how the room is used.

57
00:03:48,270 --> 00:03:50,527
I'll have to talk to the teachers

58
00:03:50,527 --> 00:03:56,330
and make sure we can all reach some agreement on a timetable to supervise the centre after class.

59
00:03:56,330 --> 00:03:59,800
But we also need to think about security, too

60
00:03:59,920 --> 00:04:02,480
Especially if we're going to invest in some new equipment.

61
00:04:02,480 --> 00:04:05,160
What about putting in an alarm?

62
00:04:05,160 --> 00:04:10,250
Good idea. The other thing I'd like to do is talk to our technicians

63
00:04:10,250 --> 00:04:14,250
and see whether we could somehow limit the access to email.

64
00:04:14,250 --> 00:04:17,330
I really don't want to see that resource misused.

65
00:04:17,330 --> 00:04:21,650
What about if we agree to only use it before and after class?

66
00:04:21,650 --> 00:04:26,230
Yes, that would be fine. OK, anyway... that's great for now.

67
00:04:26,230 --> 00:04:28,950
We'll discuss it further when we've managed to...
